Below is a focused, practical plan you can use at your annual physical and to decide about cardiology referral and osteopenia management.

Immediate checks to do at the visit
- Recheck blood pressure (both arms, seated after 5 minutes, appropriate cuff size). If very high, urgent/emergency care is needed.  
