- Known or suspected structural heart disease (low EF, valvular disease), arrhythmias (AF), or consideration of advanced testing (stress test, echocardiogram, event monitor).  
- Need for optimization of cardiovascular risk given diabetes + prior stroke — cardiology can help with risk stratification (echocardiogram, carotid/vascular imaging, lipid management, antiplatelet/anticoagulation review).  
