- “Can we recheck my BP today and set up home monitoring? Do I need a hypertension specialist?”
- “Given my diabetes, prior stroke, and sleep apnea, would you refer me to cardiology for a baseline cardiac evaluation?”
- “Do I need a DEXA scan now? What is my FRAX fracture risk and do I need medication for osteopenia?”
- “Can we check TSH and vitamin D and adjust levothyroxine if necessary to protect my bones?”
- “Are there tests you recommend (ECG, echo, lipids, urine microalbumin) before my next visit?”

