  - “Would you recommend an echocardiogram, ambulatory ECG monitoring, or a stress test before/if you refer?”
  - “Are my blood pressure and lipids at target? If not, what changes do you recommend, and should cardiology manage that?”
  - “Do I need any additional imaging (carotid, coronary CT) given my stroke history?”

